WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:07.700
Let's pray together over day 12.

2
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:12.400
I realize that there may be some things in your life that make it

3
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.020
difficult to find space and time to pray.

4
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.840
Today, I'm watching one of my seven children as he plays

5
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.880
in the room where I'm praying. In case there are

6
00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.410
distractions in your life, let me just encourage you

7
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.800
to go ahead and seek the Lord over top of and in

8
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.730
spite of those distractions, because the Lord understands,

9
00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:40.140
and He hears, and He knows. Let's pray together.

10
00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.800
Father, your Word tells me

11
00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.680
that the heart is deceitful above all things

12
00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:52.640
and beyond cure. There is no medicine on earth,

13
00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:56.080
there's no treatment on earth that can cure the problems of my heart.

14
00:00:56.880 --> 00:01:00.560
The truth is I can't even see them without the illuminating power of your

15
00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:00.940
Spirit.

16
00:01:01.900 --> 00:01:05.820
So Lord, I pray that you would look

17
00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:09.640
and search like David said, search out in me all

18
00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.580
those areas that may be unlike you.

19
00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:16.240
I pray, Lord, that you would shine your light, the light of knowledge, the light of

20
00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:20.160
the Holy Spirit, and that you would illuminate to me

21
00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:24.240
all that is in my heart, Lord. I want to see it. I want to see it with clarity.

22
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:29.380
Lord, I repent of holding you by the power

23
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:33.340
of my own stubborn self-will, holding you out of

24
00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:37.160
your rightful sanctifying place in all these areas of my

25
00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:37.460
life.

26
00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:40.920
Lord, let me see my own self-admiration.

27
00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.630
Let me see my own self-interest and

28
00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:46.700
self-righteousness. Oh Lord, when others do me wrong,

29
00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:50.660
I get self-piteous. Help me,

30
00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:54.660
Lord, to be able to see that, to be able to see the ways in which I make space

31
00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:58.340
for my own self, my self-indulgence and self-preservation.

32
00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:02.280
Oh God, help me to see my own

33
00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:03.530
self-sufficiency.

34
00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:08.320
Lord, if you don't display this to me through the power of your Spirit,

35
00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:12.230
I'll never be able to see it, and I'll never be able to solve it on my

36
00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:12.500
own.

37
00:02:13.329 --> 00:02:16.580
Lord, you can cure the incurable disease of the heart.

38
00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:20.329
Do it for me, please. I pray in Jesus' name.

39
00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:25.320
Now let's continue to pray together as you use your own words to seek

40
00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:28.360
the Lord and what He's saying and talking to you about.
